system#0.text:
:
- circuits: every component with its label and value, and every connection (which terminals or nodes it joins), sources with polarity, gates with their inputs and output, flip-flops with their pins (J, K, D, T, clock and edge) and where each pin connects;
- timing diagrams: every row and its levels per interval;
- graphs: axes, units, key points; tables: every cell; state diagrams: every state, transition, input/output label.
